# The titles and paths below are those of the demo site in demo/ (a content
# collection of posts, one of them a draft); swap them for your own content.
Feature: Content collections
  As a visitor
  I want to read the posts of the site
  So that I can follow what is new

  Scenario: The posts page lists the published posts
    Given I am on "/posts/"
    Then the page should be generated by Astro
    And I should see "The first post"
    And I should see "The second post"
    And I should not see "A draft post"
    And "main li" should have a count of 2

  Scenario: A post page is built from the collection
    Given I am on "/posts/first-post/"
    Then the page title should end with "| Astro Steps Demo"
    And I should see "This is the body of The first post."
    And the "Back to posts" link should contain "/posts/"

  Scenario: A draft is not built
    When I go to "/posts/draft-post/"
    Then the response status code should be 404
